---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Camp Queerness: Queer Summer Camp for Grownups in Tulum | Queerness Experiences" description={"Camp Queerness is a queer summer camp for grownups in Tulum: kayaking, dancing, singing, painting, and sharing stories in the Sian Ka'an biosphere reserve. Led by Santi Solis, born in Mexico and raised between two cultures. For sapphic, queer, and trans travelers who want the real thing."}>

<header class="head">
  <div class="head-top">
    <div class="shape-y"></div>
    <p class="head-eye">★ Camp Queerness · Tulum</p>
    <h1>A Queer Summer<br>Camp for Grownups.</h1>
  </div>
  <p class="head-body">Camp Queerness: overnight camp, reimagined for sapphic, queer, and trans adults. This time, exploring the jungle, and of course, with Mexican flair.</p>
  <p class="head-body" style="margin-top:12px;">For sapphic, queer, and trans travelers who prioritize small, local businesses, want to learn about culture respectfully, and are excited to be shown a side of Mexico they never had access to before, all in a space that's affirming to their identity.</p>
  <img src="/images/IMG_3923.jpeg" alt="Kayaking at sunset near Tulum" style="width:100%;border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--yellow);aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;margin-top:var(--s-md);position:relative;z-index:2;">
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);max-width:640px;margin-top:var(--s-md);position:relative;z-index:2;">Kayaking through the Sian Ka'an biosphere reserve, dancing, singing, painting, eating incredible food, and sharing stories with people who get it. Created by Santi Solis, a queer, bilingual, bicultural UCLA-trained biologist. Born in Mexico and living in Tulum for almost ten years, I bring you the real thing, not a resort version of it.</p>
  <div class="hero-grid" style="margin-top:var(--s-md);">
    <img src="/images/camp-queerness-picnic.jpg" alt="Friends painting together over a spread of fresh fruit in the jungle near Tulum" style="object-position:center 15%;">
    <img src="/images/IMG_1374.jpeg" alt="Swinging out over a cenote on a Camp Queerness trip in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_3762-crop.jpeg" alt="Birdwatching with binoculars near a lagoon in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/22943efe-94cd-4c5a-b7bd-48c4afb5ba28.jpg" alt="Friends laughing together over drinks in Tulum">
  </div>
</header>

<!-- "WHAT THESE TRIPS ACTUALLY ARE" — pulled 2026-09-12, written for multiple group trips, doesn't fit Camp Queerness alone. Full markup preserved in git history, may reuse pieces of this copy elsewhere later. -->

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
  <p class="sec-eye">What's in store</p>
  <h2>Camp<br>Itinerary</h2>

  <div class="activity-group activity-group-do">
  <div class="mini-carousel mini-carousel-2">
    <input type="radio" name="car-do" id="car-do-1" checked>
    <input type="radio" name="car-do" id="car-do-2">
    <div class="mini-carousel-track">
      <img src="/images/22943efe-94cd-4c5a-b7bd-48c4afb5ba28.jpg" alt="Friends laughing together over drinks in Tulum">
      <img src="/images/IMG_3911.jpeg" alt="Friends together on a Camp Queerness trip in Tulum">
    </div>
    <label for="car-do-2" class="mc-arrow mc-prev" data-show="1">←</label>
    <label for="car-do-2" class="mc-arrow mc-next" data-show="1">→</label>
    <label for="car-do-1" class="mc-arrow mc-prev" data-show="2">←</label>
    <label for="car-do-1" class="mc-arrow mc-next" data-show="2">→</label>
    <div class="mini-carousel-dots">
      <label for="car-do-1"></label>
      <label for="car-do-2"></label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="activity-group-h">Things you'll do</p>
  <div class="activity-boxes">
    <div class="activity-box">Kayak at sunset on the lagoon</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Float through canals built by the ancient Maya</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Rappel into a cenote</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Explore the jungle and search for birds and monkeys</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Explore a private cenote</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Learn new dance moves</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Have picnics</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Take naps</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Cooking class</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Mezcal tasting</div>
  </div>
  </div>

  <div class="activity-group activity-group-eat">
  <div class="mini-carousel mini-carousel-2">
    <input type="radio" name="car-eat" id="car-eat-1" checked>
    <input type="radio" name="car-eat" id="car-eat-2">
    <div class="mini-carousel-track">
      <img src="/images/camp-queerness-picnic-food-crop.jpg" alt="Friends painting together over a spread of fresh mangoes, avocados, and oranges in the jungle near Tulum">
      <img src="/images/food-feature-mango-crop.jpg" alt="A huge pile of fresh mangoes at a local market in Tulum">
    </div>
    <label for="car-eat-2" class="mc-arrow mc-prev" data-show="1">←</label>
    <label for="car-eat-2" class="mc-arrow mc-next" data-show="1">→</label>
    <label for="car-eat-1" class="mc-arrow mc-prev" data-show="2">←</label>
    <label for="car-eat-1" class="mc-arrow mc-next" data-show="2">→</label>
    <div class="mini-carousel-dots">
      <label for="car-eat-1"></label>
      <label for="car-eat-2"></label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="activity-group-h">Things you'll eat</p>
  <div class="activity-boxes">
    <div class="activity-box">Mexican and pre-Hispanic food</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Stuff our faces with mangoes and avocados</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Meals created by an amazing private chef</div>
  </div>
  </div>

  <div class="activity-group activity-group-learn">
  <div class="mini-carousel mini-carousel-2">
    <input type="radio" name="car-learn" id="car-learn-1" checked>
    <input type="radio" name="car-learn" id="car-learn-2">
    <div class="mini-carousel-track">
      <img src="/images/la-guarida-theater.jpg" alt="A cultural workshop at La Guarida in Tulum">
      <img src="/images/IMG_2627.jpeg" alt="A mural exploring Mexican culture in Tulum" style="object-position:center 20%;">
    </div>
    <label for="car-learn-2" class="mc-arrow mc-prev" data-show="1">←</label>
    <label for="car-learn-2" class="mc-arrow mc-next" data-show="1">→</label>
    <label for="car-learn-1" class="mc-arrow mc-prev" data-show="2">←</label>
    <label for="car-learn-1" class="mc-arrow mc-next" data-show="2">→</label>
    <div class="mini-carousel-dots">
      <label for="car-learn-1"></label>
      <label for="car-learn-2"></label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="activity-group-h">Things you'll learn</p>
  <div class="activity-boxes">
    <div class="activity-box">Mexican music, culture, and art</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Queer activism in Latin America</div>
    <div class="activity-box">Fun cultural nuances</div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
  <p class="sec-eye">Home base</p>
  <h2>Where<br>you'll stay</h2>
  <p style="background:var(--white);border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--magenta);padding:26px 28px;font-size:19px;font-weight:500;color:var(--dark);line-height:1.7;margin-top:var(--s-md);max-width:640px;">We're renting out a private villa in a super quiet neighborhood of Tulum, just outside of the town center. Close enough for easy access to explore during free time, but far enough that you'll get to hear the sounds of the jungle.</p>
</section>

<!-- CAMP QUEERNESS — the whole page is this, not boxed as one card among others -->
<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
  <div class="trips-about-grid" style="margin:var(--s-md) 0;">
    <img src="/images/group-trips-photo.jpg" alt="A group smiling together on a Queerness Experiences trip in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_4652.jpeg" alt="Friends swimming through the mangroves in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_2677.jpeg" alt="Friends at sunset on a dock in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_2244.jpeg" alt="Walking through the mangrove boardwalk in Tulum">
  </div>
</section>

<!-- QUEER CONNECT — paused, focusing on Camp Queerness. Full markup preserved in git history if reviving later. -->

<!-- LUXURY LESBIANS — paused for now, focusing on Camp Queerness. Card removed 2026-09-11, full markup preserved in git history if reviving later. -->

<section class="reviews" id="reviews">
  <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--white);">Don't take our word for it</p>
  <h2>What people say</h2>
  <p class="scroll-hint">← swipe to read more →</p>
  <div class="review-scroll">
    <div class="rcard">
      <div class="rstars">★★★★★</div>
      <input type="checkbox" id="grev1" class="rev-toggle">
      <p class="rtext">Ay ay ay, what a time!!! Santi was a dream. The entire tour, start to finish, through Tulum and into the jungle and down into the cenote was better than I ever could've imagined.</p>
      <label for="grev1" class="rev-more">Read more</label>
      <p class="rname">— Corinna Harris, Google review</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rcard">
      <div class="rstars">★★★★★</div>
      <input type="checkbox" id="grev2" class="rev-toggle">
      <p class="rtext">My partner and I booked two tours with Santi during our trip to Tulum, Street Food in the evening and Cenotes the next day. Before the trip, Santi was incredibly communicative and helpful as I planned, offering amazing local recs.</p>
      <label for="grev2" class="rev-more">Read more</label>
      <p class="rname">— Madge Dietrich, Google review</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rcard">
      <div class="rstars">★★★★★</div>
      <input type="checkbox" id="grev3" class="rev-toggle">
      <p class="rtext">We found Santi on Reddit while looking for queer experiences in Tulum and had a great tailored tour of the Muyil river. During the tour, they use their extensive knowledge in marine biology to share facts about the river.</p>
      <label for="grev3" class="rev-more">Read more</label>
      <p class="rname">— Diana Ledesma, Google review</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Queerness+Experiences/@20.4203707,-87.5893973,94594m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m8!3m7!1s0x213eac5d05676035:0x9ad4bb88e0a769c2!8m2!3d20.4200372!4d-87.259726!9m1!1b1!16s%2Fg%2F11w4tpph1c?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-reviews">Read all reviews on Google →</a>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <p class="sec-eye">Before you book</p>
  <h2>Questions about<br>Camp Queerness</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq6" checked>
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq6">Is Tulum safe and welcoming for queer and trans people?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Tulum is a genuinely inclusive town where queer and trans people can just exist, not just visit. For the full, honest breakdown, read <a href="/blog/is-tulum-queer-trans-friendly">Is Tulum LGBTQ+ Friendly?</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq1">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq1">Who can join Camp Queerness?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Camp Queerness is specifically for queer, sapphic, and trans travelers. Period.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-call">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-call">Can I talk to you before I book?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes! Join the waitlist below and let me know you'd like to talk first, and we'll schedule a call.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-stay">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-stay">Where will we be staying?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">We'll be staying at a nice villa in Tulum town. Even though it's called camp, we won't be camping, but we will be spending a lot of time outdoors.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq2">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq2">How is Camp Queerness different from a tour?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Tours are single-day experiences with just your group. Camp Queerness is an overnight camp that brings together travelers who don't already know each other yet, for a shared experience full of new places and new people.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq3">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq3">How is this different from other queer and sapphic trips?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">I'm a bicultural, bilingual, queer and trans UCLA-trained biologist, and I created Camp Queerness myself. That gives you insight into Mexico in a way you can only get from a local person. I've been running tours for queer and trans travelers here in Tulum for over three years.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq4">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq4">Do you host trips outside Tulum?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Not yet, but I have plans for a climbing trip in San Cristóbal de las Casas, plus trips to Colombia and Argentina, coming soon. If there's anywhere else you're interested in, let me know.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq5">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq5">I'm bringing my group to Tulum, can you give me your local insight?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. If you're bringing a queer group to Tulum, reach out and I'll help you get local insight, connect you with local businesses and private chefs, or co-host with you. <a href="/bring-your-group">Let's plan it together →</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq6">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq6">Is Tulum safe and welcoming for queer and trans people?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Tulum is a genuinely inclusive town where queer and trans people can just exist, not just visit. For the full, honest breakdown, read <a href="/blog/is-tulum-queer-trans-friendly">Is Tulum LGBTQ+ Friendly?</a></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:0 var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);text-align:center;">
  <a href="/waitlist" class="btn-p" style="display:inline-block;">Join the Waitlist →</a>
</section>

<!-- HOST CTA moved to /bring-your-group — keeping this page focused on one offer: Camp Queerness. -->

</Layout>

<style is:global>
@font-face{font-family:'CheddarGothicStencil';src:url('/fonts/CheddarGothicStencil.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{overflow-x:hidden;max-width:100vw;}
:root{
  --magenta:#C8185A;--yellow:#F5A623;--terra:#B5390F;--dark:#1a1a18;
  --white:#FDFCF9;--bone:#F5F0E8;--muted:#4A4034;--border:rgba(26,26,24,0.12);
  --s-sm:16px;--s-md:32px;--s-lg:64px;
  --ff:'Archivo Black','Space Grotesk',sans-serif;--fb:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
}
body{background:var(--bone);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}

/* HEADER */
.head{background:var(--terra);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);position:relative;}
.head-top{position:relative;overflow:hidden;margin:calc(var(--s-md) * -1) calc(var(--s-sm) * -1) 0;padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-md);}
.shape-y{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:40%;height:100%;background:var(--yellow);clip-path:polygon(28% 0,100% 0,100% 100%,0 100%);z-index:0;}
.head-body{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:640px;}
.head-eye{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin-bottom:4px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
.head h1{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:40px;line-height:0.96;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--white);position:relative;z-index:2;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);paint-order:stroke fill;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.head p{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);line-height:1.7;position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:520px;}
.head-hook{font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:700;font-size:16px !important;color:var(--white) !important;max-width:460px;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);position:relative;z-index:2;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.35);border-left:3px solid var(--yellow);padding:10px 14px;}
.pull-quote{background:var(--bone);border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--yellow);padding:20px 24px;margin:var(--s-md) 0 0;font-family:var(--ff);font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;}
.trips-details-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:var(--s-md);}
.trips-details-list li{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--dark);display:flex;gap:10px;line-height:1.55;}
.trips-details-list li::before{content:'→';color:var(--magenta);flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700;}

/* TRIPS */
.trips{padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);}
.trip{border:3px solid var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-md);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--dark);overflow:hidden;background:var(--white);}
.trip-photo{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,26,24,0.05),rgba(26,26,24,0.05) 12px,rgba(26,26,24,0.09) 12px,rgba(26,26,24,0.09) 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(26,26,24,0.4);text-align:center;padding:12px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);position:relative;}
.trip-photo-img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.trip-status{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 10px;border-right:3px solid var(--dark);border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);}
.status-confirmed{background:var(--magenta);color:var(--white);}
.status-soon{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--dark);}
.activity-group-h{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);margin:var(--s-md) 0 10px;}
.activity-group{padding:var(--s-md);margin-bottom:var(--s-md);}
.activity-group-do{background:rgba(200,24,90,0.06);}
.activity-group-eat{background:rgba(245,166,35,0.10);}
.activity-group-learn{background:rgba(27,77,107,0.07);}
.activity-group .activity-box{background:var(--white);}
.mini-carousel{position:relative;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--magenta);margin-top:var(--s-md);}
.mini-carousel input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
.mini-carousel-track{display:flex;width:300%;height:100%;transition:transform 0.4s ease;}
.mini-carousel-track img{width:33.3333%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;}
.mini-carousel-2 .mini-carousel-track{width:200%;}
.mini-carousel-2 .mini-carousel-track img{width:50%;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(1):checked ~ .mini-carousel-track{transform:translateX(0%);}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .mini-carousel-track{transform:translateX(-33.3333%);}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(3):checked ~ .mini-carousel-track{transform:translateX(-66.6666%);}
.mini-carousel-2 input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .mini-carousel-track{transform:translateX(-50%);}
.mini-carousel-dots{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:8px;z-index:2;}
.mc-arrow{display:none;position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:3;width:34px;height:34px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5);color:var(--white);font-size:18px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;}
.mc-arrow.mc-prev{left:10px;}
.mc-arrow.mc-next{right:10px;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(1):checked ~ .mc-arrow[data-show="1"]{display:flex;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .mc-arrow[data-show="2"]{display:flex;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(3):checked ~ .mc-arrow[data-show="3"]{display:flex;}
.mini-carousel-dots label{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);border:2px solid var(--dark);cursor:pointer;display:block;}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(1):checked ~ .mini-carousel-dots label:nth-child(1){background:var(--magenta);}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .mini-carousel-dots label:nth-child(2){background:var(--magenta);}
.mini-carousel input:nth-of-type(3):checked ~ .mini-carousel-dots label:nth-child(3){background:var(--magenta);}
.activity-group-h:first-of-type{margin-top:var(--s-md);}
.activity-boxes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}
.activity-box{background:var(--bone);border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--magenta);padding:16px;font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--dark);display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:90px;line-height:1.35;min-width:0;}
.activity-box-photo{background-size:cover;background-position:center;position:relative;padding:0;overflow:hidden;}
.activity-box-photo span{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.55);color:var(--white);padding:8px 12px;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;}
@media(min-width:600px){.activity-boxes{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;}}

.trip-body{padding:20px;}
